      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Pero Hermes no se quedó mucho tiempo en la cuna. Salió y caminó hasta la entrada de la cueva.",
          "en": "But Hermes did not stay in his cradle for long. He climbed out and walked to the door of the cave."
        },
        {
          "es": "Allí encontró una tortuga de tierra, lenta, que estaba comiendo pasto.",
          "en": "There he found a tortoise, a slow turtle that lives on land. It was eating grass."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hermes se rió. Tuvo una idea. Se llevó la tortuga adentro y usó su caparazón redondo.",
          "en": "Hermes laughed. He had an idea. He took the tortoise inside, and used its round shell."
        },
        {
          "es": "Le agregó dos brazos de madera y siete cuerdas.",
          "en": "He added two arms of wood, and seven strings."
        },
        {
          "es": "Al mediodía ya había inventado la lira, un arpa pequeña. Y se puso a cantar.",
          "en": "By midday, he had invented the lyre, a small harp. And he began to sing."
        }
      ],
