      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Junto al río, Apolo vio lo que quedaba de sus dos vacas. Y se enojó otra vez.",
          "en": "At the river, Apollo saw what was left of his two cows. He grew angry again."
        },
        {
          "es": "Intentó atar a Hermes con ramas. Pero las ramas se soltaron y echaron raíces en el suelo.",
          "en": "He tried to tie Hermes up with branches. But the branches fell off and grew roots in the ground."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces Hermes sacó su lira y empezó a tocar.",
          "en": "Then Hermes took out his lyre and began to play."
        },
        {
          "es": "Apolo nunca había oído una música así. Su enojo se derritió.",
          "en": "Apollo had never heard music like this. His anger melted away."
        },
        {
          "es": "«Dame esa lira», dijo, «y puedes quedarte con las vacas».",
          "en": "\"Give me that lyre,\" he said, \"and you can keep the cows.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Así la lira pasó a Apolo. Desde ese día, siempre la tocó.",
          "en": "So the lyre went to Apollo. From that day on, he always played it."
        }
